Portraits for the account holder and the beneficiary book.

One square image per file, named for the person. Anything from 96px up is
enough; they are drawn at 44px and below.

  ada-okafor.png       the account holder
  carlos-mamani.png    Carlos Mamani
  maria-quispe.png     Maria Quispe
  diego-rojas.png      Diego Rojas
  valeria-ticona.png   Valeria Ticona
  ana-flores.png       Ana Flores
  bruno-almeida.png    Bruno Almeida

A missing file is not an error. The Avatar component falls back to the
monogram disc, which is what every business counterparty gets anyway.
